Adam Newman, M.D. wrote:
> I guess I could create an account on my computer called "wizard", but how
> would I use "su" from the terminal to launch [Nethack] in wizard mode? Can you
> give me the keystrokes needed??

Sure, I can. You create the user wizard and give him a password. Then 
you open a terminal and insert the following commands:
su - wizard
[Now you type in wizard's password]
cd /bla/nethack.app/the/subdirectory/where/the/binary/is
./nethack -u wizard -D


PS: I don't know where the nethack-binary is in the OSX version, but I
know it's somewhere in the .app

